      "agq.quiz.prompt": "An experienced tester sits with a newly built feature \u2014 no script \u2014 probing for surprising behaviour and usability problems. Which quadrant is this?",
      "agq.quiz.a": "Q1 \u2014 technology-facing, supports the team",
